Data source attribution
=======================

This package contains no baseball data. It contains a mapping: an ontology, a
connection descriptor, and fourteen RML TriplesMaps that describe how to read a
database. Every value a consumer sees is fetched from that database at query
time and is never copied into this repository or into anything this repository
publishes.

The data those mappings read is the Sean Lahman Baseball Database, a season-level
record of Major League Baseball from 1871 forward.

  Source:         The Lahman Baseball Database
                  https://sabr.org/lahman-database/
